    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt matter though. talking to a stranger or a counselor doesnt change the fact that i'm radioactive. i ruined everything. people dont just \"move on\" from what happened, they just decide you don't exist anymore. i'm already dead to the world, i'm just waiting for my body to catch up.",
