    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but family is part of the world. if they've already written me off, then the world has already finished with me. there's no point in fighting to stay in a space where you're not even allowed to exist. it feels more like i'm just a mistake that needs to be corrected. like, why keep up the charade of being alive when the version of me that mattered is already gone?",
